(* Real hand-rolled `SemioBrepMutation` op text grammar (protocol::OpText) -- one line of
   compact RFC8259 JSON, tag field "mutation" discriminating the 23 variants; see
   ../🔣️component.json for the variant/field enumeration. *)
op line = json value ;
json value = json object ;
json object = "{", [ json member, { ",", json member } ], "}" ;
json member = json string, ":", json value ;
